NODE id=matrix/cody/internal/delegate.ClassOf kind=func
  digest=b3:48ac3b2380f41c5e3eb7356600a2ab8091411bc709147bb85d3bc76a6abee92e file=cody/internal/delegate/classify.go range=146:166 lang=go exported=true byte_range=5167:5897
  sig=func ClassOf(err error) FailureClass
  doc=ClassOf extracts the shared FailureClass carried by err. A daemon HTTP error\n(anywhere in the wrap chain) is mapped by status+body; a context\ncancellation / deadline is left unclassified (the loop handles ctx\nseparately); any other non-nil error is treated as transient (a transport\nfailure — connection refused, reset, timeout). A nil error is ClassNone.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/cody/internal/delegate/classify.go

