  sig=delegate.FailureClass
  doc=ClassPending is a structured 422 needing slot values: a clarify. It is\ncarried back as an actionable slot-fill (the clarify pass-through, P4),\nnot reworded prose.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/cody/internal/delegate/classify.go

